    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορβᾶν</span></b>  (indecl.), Hebr. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>qorbān, gift</i> or
				<i>votive offering for the service of God,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Marc.
				7.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				4.4.4
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορβανᾶς</span></b> , ὁ, <i>the treasury of
				the temple</i> at Jerusalem, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				27.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.9.4
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορβωνᾶς</span>
			).</div>
